				<wikidot:authorName>A Random Day</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1841781</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Looking to form or join a team? Look no further! This is the official LFT thread, where people interested in joining the contest can look for and find teammates.</p> <p>There are two ways to use this thread:</p> <ol> <li>If you see someone reply to this thread that you'd like to work with, send them a private message on Wikidot or IRC!</li> <li>If you don't yet see anyone reply to this thread that you want to work with, reply to this thread yourself with three GOIs that you want to write about! If someone PMs you and you two form a team, edit your post to note that you've formed a team!</li> </ol> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
